    licence. The captain fee is 2 per completed 110: invoice = hexbit · (n · n · n) = 108,
    gross = invoice + coins = 110, fee = gross − invoice = coins = 2. Incomplete invoice + seed
    (109) is not the fee and delivers no unlock. A paid fee delivers occupancy unlock: coins =
    seed + seed, faces = rays + rays, coins · bits = coins · (vertices · hexbit) (the 64 save),
    mintOf hexbit · (n · n · n) = (vertices + vertices) · (n · n · n) (A432), keys on every ray.
    Occupancy unlock is harmonic Lean compute. theorem millenium : prize ≠ rays.
    Not a Clay prize. Commercial use is
    billed that fee as consideration for a separate commercial licence from the author; CC
